			<div class="content" id="post-content-4864755">
									

<p>Just a heads up, we already have <a href="/scp-3502">SCP-3502</a> (The Kangaroo Sign) which plays on the same premise of &quot;animals that are often hit by people in vehicles get their revenge on said vehicles and people&quot; but does not rely on the shock horror of deaths.</p>
<p>What you have here feels like a fairly common urban legend, which might be workable based on the imagery of the deer (though we already have some well-known anomalous deer on the mainsite (you can see them in this listing: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/system:page-tags/tag/cervine">http://www.scpwiki.com/system:page-tags/tag/cervine</a>) but is also kind of bland given that it relies on typical horror genre tropes like the mysterious mist, accidentally harming allies/family while trying to harm something else(the movie Oculus ends with this), and the overly convenient found journal.</p>
<p>Personally I recommend delving more into the lore of the deer from a different perspective, maybe a colony of wildlife creatures who consider it their guardian, or the like. A Group of Interest article might be a better format for something like this.</p>

							</div>

								
					
